  ```js
    return store.updateTicket(id, { assignee_id: agentId, owner_id: agentId });
  ```

- [ ] Evidence: `npm test` passes unchanged — dual-write only adds a field, nothing yet
  reads it.

### 2. Migrate — internal reads move to `owner_id`

- [ ] In `reopenTicket` (line 38–44), change line 42 from
  `if (t.assignee_id && t.assignee_id !== agentId) notifyAgent(store, t.assignee_id, ...)`
  to:

  ```js
