  ```js
    store.addRating(id, { owner_id: t.owner_id, score, rated_at: now.toISOString() });
    if (score <= 2 && t.owner_id) notifyAgent(store, t.owner_id, { type: 'ticket_rated_low', ticketId: id, score });
  ```

- [ ] In `test/tickets.test.js` line 20, change `assert.equal(t.assignee_id, null);` to
